  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5605.21 Auto Insurance Companies or Self-Insured Entities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5605.21 Auto Insurance Companies or Self-Insured Entities. For the purpose of a motor vehicle record being requested pursuant to RSA 260:14, IV(a)(2), an insurance company that is authorized to write automobile insurance policies in New Hampshire, or a self-insured entity, or their authorized agent shall not obtain or use a motor vehicle record for use in connection with a claims investigation activity, anti-fraud activity, rating or underwriting that is not related to a motor vehicle insurance policy.\n\nSource. #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5600.html"
}
